<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47199" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">syllăba</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sul-</span></b> ), ae, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συλλαβή,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>a syllable.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i><span class="en">Plaut.
				Bacch. 3, 3, 29</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">syllaba brevior aut longior,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Par. 3, 2, 26</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">syllabarum numerus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					de Or. 3, 47, 183</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">syllaba longa brevi subjecta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor. A.
					P. 251</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">syllaba prima brevis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					P. 4, 12, 12</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Quint. 1, 5, 62</span></i>; <i><span class="en">7, 9, 13</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep.
				117, 5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">88,
			42</span></i> et saep.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jurisconsultus, auceps syllabarum,</span>”
				<i>a word-catcher</i>, <i>captious critic</i>,
						<i>caviller</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. de Or. 1, 55, 236</span></i>
			.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, in plur., <i>verses</i>, <i>poems</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Verona docti syllabas amat vatis (i. e.
					Catulli),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					1, 62, 1</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
